### **Kiosk Design Tokens (CRITICAL)**
```css
/* Kiosk-specific design requirements */
.kiosk-text {
  font-size: 18px; /* MINIMUM - standing users need larger text */
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: #1a1a1a; /* High contrast required */
}

.kiosk-sticky-interface {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  height: 15vh; /* 15% of viewport height */
  z-index: 1000;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
}

.kiosk-main-content {
  height: 85vh; /* Leave room for sticky interface */
  overflow: hidden; /* No scrollbars in kiosk mode */
}
```

## ❌ **STRICT PROHIBITIONS**

### **Architecture Violations**
- ❌ **DO NOT** modify 2-second polling interval
- ❌ **DO NOT** use WebSockets or SSE
- ❌ **DO NOT** await async card generation in API responses
- ❌ **DO NOT** use `require()` in frontend code

### **Kiosk UX Violations**
- ❌ **DO NOT** add close buttons (voice-only kiosk interaction)
- ❌ **DO NOT** create touch/click interactions
- ❌ **DO NOT** use fonts smaller than 18px
- ❌ **DO NOT** display multiple cards simultaneously (overlapping issue)
- ❌ **DO NOT** use scrollable content

